port net/deltachat-rpc-server
type port
reason "DragonFly: quinn-udp takes the recvmsg path, without IP_RECVTOS; netdev lists interfaces as on the BSDs, without a gateway (dragonfly/@<line> cargo-crate patches)"

# patch-cargo-crates_netdev-0.31.0_*: netdev gates its interface code on
# the other BSDs only (no interfaces(), InterfaceType::value()). Take the
# BSD getifaddrs path on DragonFly, without the routing-socket gateway
# lookup, whose rt_msghdr layout is FreeBSD's.
